;
; How Nutshell files a deck of flashcards in MYRA (nutshell_rules.h NS4):
; its number, how many cards it holds, the day it was made and the day it
; was last reviewed (days since 1970: seven digits reach 9999-12-31). The
; model's own checks say what the values may mean; this says whether they
; make a record.
^ZXNUTSHELL(deck:i6) = cards:i4! ^ made:i7! ^ reviewed:i7!
